      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Dear VRchat Staff: We need urgently South America servers on VRC, it's a huge community with many players, supporters, groups that are dedicated to the game, there are huge projects made by Brazilians and others in South America to build a better community not only in Brazil but all over the globe, international communities made to boost the game popularity.\n\nThis improvement is extremely necessary; it's an active community that wants to support the game by subscribing to the VRC Plus+, but without the price localization, it's way too hard to support your amazing work.\n\nAs you can see in this initiative and others, what we are trying to tell the staff is that we love your game, and each day that goes by without South America servers makes it harder for us to keep supporting your work.\n\nFrom all the content creators and users that want to support VR CHAT to the VRC Team: I really hope that you all consider our request.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
